  "description": [
    "Floating lazily from the east, dying embers fall to the ground and release an unsettling whisper of hisses that lingers in the air.  A wooden fleet lies in wait behind a row of monstrous golden curls willow trees, their coiled and lengthy appendages swaying relentlessly in search of unsuspecting prey but receding at the first sign of defeat.  Dangling from a low-hanging limb, a rusted placard creaks noisily with each bend."
